Push your heavy weapon beyond its normal limits to trigger a powerful effect. This will immediately disable your heavy weapon and expends all remaining ammunition.

Flamethrower: Detonate your fuel tanks, creating a radius 4 explosion that launches you to a chosen tile in range [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)]. Enemies caught within the explosion take [172, 231, 277, 316, 351 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage, and further fire damage equal to [50%, 73%, 91%, 106%, 120% (TL1-5)] of their current burning damage from the volatile fuel.

Shockstaff: Drive your staff into the ground, discharging all remaining power to deal [150%, 183%, 209%, 230%, 250% (TL1-5)] shockstaff damage as lightning in radius [2, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)]. Those struck will be knocked back [5, 6, 7, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] tiles, and if they strike a wall they will emit a static pulse dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] lightning damage in radius 1 and stunning them for 5 turns.

Boltgun: Overcharge your boltgun, firing a single deadly bolt dealing [150%, 183%, 209%, 230%, 250% (TL1-5)] steamgun damage as acid in a piercing line. For each negative physical, magical, or mental effect on the target, they take an additional [5%, 10%, 13%, 17%, 20% (TL1-5)] damage (to a maximum of [25%, 50%, 69%, 85%, 100% (TL1-5)]) and the duration of each negative effect is increased by [2, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns.
